WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.330 --> 00:00:03.403
-There´s been a lot
of news this week

00:00:03.403 --> 00:00:05.271
on the Donald Trump legal front.

00:00:05.271 --> 00:00:06.806
We found out
stunning new details

00:00:06.806 --> 00:00:08.675
about a memo
one of his lawyers wrote

00:00:08.675 --> 00:00:10.844
on how to overturn the results
of the 2020 election.

00:00:10.844 --> 00:00:14.014
He sued his niece
over damning tax documents

00:00:14.014 --> 00:00:15.648
he inadvertently admitted
were real.

00:00:15.648 --> 00:00:17.984
His lawyers knew days
after the election their claims

00:00:17.984 --> 00:00:19.652
of widespread fraud were B.S.,

00:00:19.652 --> 00:00:21.821
and there are reportedly
more indictments coming

00:00:21.821 --> 00:00:23.723
in the Trump organization
tax fraud case.

00:00:23.723 --> 00:00:26.559
For more on all that,
it´s time for a closer look.

00:00:26.559 --> 00:00:30.196
♫♫

00:00:30.196 --> 00:00:32.065
It´s been so nice
not having to think

00:00:32.065 --> 00:00:33.867
or care about what
Donald Trump´s been up to

00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:35.068
these past few months.

00:00:35.068 --> 00:00:37.637
It´s like when you finally
get a cast removed

00:00:37.637 --> 00:00:38.872
and you get to shower without

00:00:38.872 --> 00:00:40.874
taping a plastic bag
to your arm,

00:00:40.874 --> 00:00:43.076
which is why it´s such a bummer
that he and everyone around him

00:00:43.076 --> 00:00:45.078
keep hinting he might
run again in 2024.

00:00:45.078 --> 00:00:46.746
It´s kind of like how Mets fans

00:00:46.746 --> 00:00:48.148
are relieved
when the season´s over

00:00:48.148 --> 00:00:49.649
so they can stop
feeling miserable.

00:00:49.649 --> 00:00:50.650
And then they remember,

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:53.153
"Oh, right, the Jets."

00:00:53.153 --> 00:00:54.721
But hey, look,
on the bright side.

00:00:54.721 --> 00:00:57.057
At least the Jets
can only lose once a week.

00:00:57.057 --> 00:01:00.393
They´re Thursday this week?!

00:01:00.393 --> 00:01:02.062
That said,
even though it´s liberating

00:01:02.062 --> 00:01:03.430
to have Trump out of the news,

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:05.965
it´s still important to hold him
accountable for his crimes

00:01:05.965 --> 00:01:09.302
and prevent him from doing again
what he tried to do in 2020.

00:01:09.302 --> 00:01:10.570
He´s still implicated

00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:12.472
in multiple investigations
across the country,

00:01:12.472 --> 00:01:15.475
as CNN pointed out
when they tried to list

00:01:15.475 --> 00:01:16.609
all of his ongoing civil

00:01:16.609 --> 00:01:18.978
and criminal matters
in a recent segment.

00:01:18.978 --> 00:01:21.781
-He is still facing a slew
of different lawsuits.

00:01:21.781 --> 00:01:23.216
We have a full screen that show

00:01:23.216 --> 00:01:25.185
all the criminal cases
and civil --

00:01:25.185 --> 00:01:28.521
I actually do not have time
to go through them all.

00:01:28.521 --> 00:01:30.790
-Trump has so many
legal problems,

00:01:30.790 --> 00:01:34.928
CNN doesn´t even have time
to go through them all -- CNN.

00:01:34.928 --> 00:01:36.463
They´re a 24-hour news network.

00:01:36.463 --> 00:01:37.864
All they do is the news.

00:01:37.864 --> 00:01:39.466
It´s not like they hand it off

00:01:39.466 --> 00:01:41.101
at 4:00 p.m.
to their baking show,

00:01:41.101 --> 00:01:42.602
"The Knead with Jake Tapper"

00:01:42.602 --> 00:01:46.106
or their 5:00 p.m. dating show,
"On the Prowl with the Wolf."

00:01:46.106 --> 00:01:47.607
[ Laughter ]

00:01:47.607 --> 00:01:48.842
And on top of all of that,

00:01:48.842 --> 00:01:51.678
Trump is now suing
his own niece.

00:01:51.678 --> 00:01:52.879
-Former President Donald Trump

00:01:52.879 --> 00:01:55.715
has filed a lawsuit
in New York State Court.

00:01:55.715 --> 00:01:58.585
This time, he´s suing his niece,
Mary Trump,

00:01:58.585 --> 00:02:00.220
and three
New York Times journalist

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:02.489
over what he´s called
the illegal disclosure

00:02:02.489 --> 00:02:04.224
of his tax information.

00:02:04.224 --> 00:02:06.292
-Mary Trump said this
in response.

00:02:06.292 --> 00:02:08.161
"I think he´s a loser.

00:02:08.161 --> 00:02:09.362
It´s desperation.

00:02:09.362 --> 00:02:10.964
The walls are closing in,

00:02:10.964 --> 00:02:12.832
and he´s throwing anything
against the wall

00:02:12.832 --> 00:02:14.701
that he thinks will stick.

00:02:14.701 --> 00:02:16.436
As is always the case
with Donald,

00:02:16.436 --> 00:02:18.338
he´ll try and change
the subject."

00:02:18.338 --> 00:02:19.839
-Imagine suing your own niece.

00:02:19.839 --> 00:02:21.574
I mean, fortunately,
his lawyer does have experience

00:02:21.574 --> 00:02:24.244
suing family members since Rudy
sued his cousin for divorce.

00:02:24.244 --> 00:02:25.745
But aside from the family drama,

00:02:25.745 --> 00:02:26.846
there´s a crucial takeaway

00:02:26.846 --> 00:02:28.214
in this case that
we should focus on,

00:02:28.214 --> 00:02:31.184
because in filing this lawsuit,
Trump was forced to admit

00:02:31.184 --> 00:02:33.052
that all those stories about

00:02:33.052 --> 00:02:34.487
how he had lost tons of money

00:02:34.487 --> 00:02:36.322
and paid virtually
nothing in taxes,

00:02:36.322 --> 00:02:37.490
which he had previously

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:39.926
dismissed as fake news
were actually true.

00:02:39.926 --> 00:02:42.262
For example,
you might remember that in 2018

00:02:42.262 --> 00:02:43.963
the New York Times
reported that Trump

00:02:43.963 --> 00:02:46.466
engaged in all kinds
of suspect tax schemes

00:02:46.466 --> 00:02:48.902
as he hoarded the wealth
handed down by his father.

00:02:48.902 --> 00:02:50.870
Then in 2019, the Times reported

00:02:50.870 --> 00:02:53.540
that Trump had lost
over a billion dollars

00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:54.707
in the ´80s and ´90s,

00:02:54.707 --> 00:02:56.743
and then in 2020,
The Times reported

00:02:56.743 --> 00:02:59.412
that Trump paid $750
in federal income taxes

00:02:59.412 --> 00:03:01.181
the year he won the presidency.

00:03:01.181 --> 00:03:02.549
In his first year
in the White House,

00:03:02.549 --> 00:03:04.817
he paid another $750.

00:03:04.817 --> 00:03:06.753
He had paid no income taxes
at all

00:03:06.753 --> 00:03:08.688
in 10 of the previous 15 years,

00:03:08.688 --> 00:03:10.390
largely because he reported

00:03:10.390 --> 00:03:12.192
losing much more money
than he made.

00:03:12.192 --> 00:03:13.359
He was in the Oval Office

00:03:13.359 --> 00:03:15.028
as president
of the United States,

00:03:15.028 --> 00:03:18.131
and he only paid $750
in federal income taxes

00:03:18.131 --> 00:03:19.465
to the country he was in charge.

00:03:19.465 --> 00:03:21.301
That´s like finding out Tim Cook

00:03:21.301 --> 00:03:23.303
has an old Motorola flip hone.

00:03:23.303 --> 00:03:26.372
"$1,000 for an iPhone.
No, thank you.

00:03:26.372 --> 00:03:29.175
I will stick to texting in T9."

00:03:29.175 --> 00:03:31.010
There were all kinds
of shady gimmicks

00:03:31.010 --> 00:03:32.312
documented in these stories,

00:03:32.312 --> 00:03:34.480
some of which amounted
to outright fraud

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:36.149
that could constitute
criminal tax fraud,

00:03:36.149 --> 00:03:37.183
as the Times put it.

00:03:37.183 --> 00:03:39.085
Yet somehow,
it´s at risk of being one

00:03:39.085 --> 00:03:42.055
of those insane Trump stories
that just goes flying by

00:03:42.055 --> 00:03:43.756
in history classes
decades from now.

00:03:43.756 --> 00:03:45.058
Textbooks will be replaced

00:03:45.058 --> 00:03:47.527
by little microchips
they implant in your brain,

00:03:47.527 --> 00:03:49.629
and high school sophomores
will just sit there

00:03:49.629 --> 00:03:52.232
as they download
the entire Trump presidency

00:03:52.232 --> 00:03:53.833
into their cerebral cortex --

00:03:53.833 --> 00:03:56.269
Impeached twice. $750.

00:03:56.269 --> 00:03:57.804
Did the Carlton dance?

00:03:57.804 --> 00:04:00.073
Anyway, the point is,
when that story came out,

00:04:00.073 --> 00:04:02.041
Trump, as usual,
claimed it was fake.

00:04:02.041 --> 00:04:03.810
In your tax return, sir,
does that sound right,

00:04:03.810 --> 00:04:05.578
that you were paying
a couple hundred dollars a year

00:04:05.578 --> 00:04:06.579
in federal income taxes

00:04:06.579 --> 00:04:07.747
-It´s fake news.

00:04:07.747 --> 00:04:10.383
It´s totally fake news,
made up, fake.

00:04:10.383 --> 00:04:11.784
Totally fake news.

00:04:11.784 --> 00:04:14.087
No, actually, I paid tax,

00:04:14.087 --> 00:04:16.856
but -- and you´ll see that
as soon as my tax returns.

00:04:16.856 --> 00:04:18.524
It´s under audit.

00:04:18.524 --> 00:04:20.827
They´ve been under audit
for a long time.

00:04:20.827 --> 00:04:22.562
They´re under audit.

00:04:22.562 --> 00:04:25.064
And when they´re not,
I would be proud to show you.

00:04:25.064 --> 00:04:26.666
But that´s just fake news.

00:04:26.666 --> 00:04:29.469
I mean, the stories that
I read are so fake.

00:04:29.469 --> 00:04:30.803
They´re so phony.

00:04:30.803 --> 00:04:32.905
-Oh, man.
Remember that whole audit thing.

00:04:32.905 --> 00:04:34.774
I´m sure that´ll be
wrapped up any day now.

00:04:34.774 --> 00:04:36.643
The audit is taking longer

00:04:36.643 --> 00:04:39.112
than it took to get
season 3 of "Succession."

00:04:39.112 --> 00:04:41.281
You´re making us wait
until October 17th, HBO?

00:04:41.281 --> 00:04:43.383
That´s like a month from now.

00:04:43.383 --> 00:04:45.952
This is taking longer than
it takes Kendall to say,

00:04:45.952 --> 00:04:48.888
"Uh...Dad."

00:04:48.888 --> 00:04:50.056
Seriously, though,

00:04:50.056 --> 00:04:51.658
whatever happened with
that audit, anyway?

00:04:51.658 --> 00:04:53.326
I mean, I´m not an IRS auditor,

00:04:53.326 --> 00:04:56.229
but I would assume Trump
would be the dream case.

00:04:56.229 --> 00:04:57.697
If I were there, I would open up

00:04:57.697 --> 00:04:59.899
every manila folder
they put on my desk,

00:04:59.899 --> 00:05:02.468
like Charlie Bucket
opening a Wonka bar.

00:05:02.468 --> 00:05:05.171
I mean, just like looking,
looking for Trump --

00:05:05.171 --> 00:05:06.839
It´s the [bleep] golden ticket.

00:05:06.839 --> 00:05:10.176
But no, we can´t go after Trump
for decades of brazen tax fraud.

00:05:10.176 --> 00:05:12.312
Some woman named Lorraine
in Little Rock

00:05:12.312 --> 00:05:14.480
wrote off a pedicure
as a business expense,

00:05:14.480 --> 00:05:17.016
so let´s rain hell down
on her instead.

00:05:17.016 --> 00:05:19.552
Lorraine feels more confident
when her feet look good,

00:05:19.552 --> 00:05:21.688
and that does make her
a better travel agent.

00:05:21.688 --> 00:05:24.090
So lay off Lorraine.

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:26.025
Anyway,
Trump called it fake and phony,

00:05:26.025 --> 00:05:28.061
but in his lawsuit against
his niece, Mary Trump,

00:05:28.061 --> 00:05:31.197
he was forced to admit that
he was lying when he said that

00:05:31.197 --> 00:05:33.333
and that the tax documents
were actually authentic.

00:05:33.333 --> 00:05:35.168
In the lawsuit,
Trump´s lawyers write

00:05:35.168 --> 00:05:36.669
that Mary Trump
came into possession

00:05:36.669 --> 00:05:37.904
of more than 40,000 pages

00:05:37.904 --> 00:05:39.505
of highly sensitive,
proprietary,

00:05:39.505 --> 00:05:41.040
private
and confidential documents,

00:05:41.040 --> 00:05:43.810
including but not limited
to financial documents,

00:05:43.810 --> 00:05:45.578
accountings, tax records,

00:05:45.578 --> 00:05:47.847
income tax returns,
bank statements,

00:05:47.847 --> 00:05:50.350
legal documents,
and other related documents.

00:05:50.350 --> 00:05:53.119
So they´re admitting
the documents were real.

00:05:53.119 --> 00:05:55.121
I feel like this should be
big news, but then again,

00:05:55.121 --> 00:05:57.023
I doubt Trump supporters
are at home

00:05:57.023 --> 00:05:58.558
poring over legal proceedings,

00:05:58.558 --> 00:06:00.793
deciphering the veracity
of his claims.

00:06:00.793 --> 00:06:04.030
"Honey, it says here the
tax documents were authentic,

00:06:04.030 --> 00:06:05.331
which would imply, of course,

00:06:05.331 --> 00:06:07.934
that when the president
called them fake news,

00:06:07.934 --> 00:06:10.069
he wasn´t being
entirely truthful.

00:06:10.069 --> 00:06:11.304
"It only stands to reason then

00:06:11.304 --> 00:06:15.341
that he´s been lying
about other things.

00:06:15.341 --> 00:06:17.076
Hand me the horse medicine.
I need to think.

00:06:17.076 --> 00:06:18.544
No, no, no.

00:06:18.544 --> 00:06:20.546
Not the pills.
The paste."

00:06:25.418 --> 00:06:27.487
So Trump´s got
a mountain of legal issues,

00:06:27.487 --> 00:06:29.989
and now we know that even
by Trump´s own admission,

00:06:29.989 --> 00:06:32.425
all those allegations
of tax fraud from the Times

00:06:32.425 --> 00:06:33.993
were based on
authentic documents.

00:06:33.993 --> 00:06:35.762
With all that said,
at this point,

00:06:35.762 --> 00:06:38.164
it´s clearly very unlikely

00:06:38.164 --> 00:06:39.565
Trump himself will be indicted

00:06:39.565 --> 00:06:41.367
or arrested for anything,
which is insane.

00:06:41.367 --> 00:06:42.602
His company is accused of fraud.

00:06:42.602 --> 00:06:43.836
He´s personally accused

00:06:43.836 --> 00:06:45.772
of all kinds of shady
tax avoidance gimmicks.

00:06:45.772 --> 00:06:47.039
Robert Mueller accused him

00:06:47.039 --> 00:06:48.975
of 10 different instances
of obstruction of justice.

00:06:48.975 --> 00:06:51.110
He was
an unindicted co-conspirator,

00:06:51.110 --> 00:06:53.546
an indictment to cover up hush
money payments to a porn star.

00:06:53.546 --> 00:06:55.381
He incited a violent mob

00:06:55.381 --> 00:06:57.617
to attack the Capitol
and overthrow democracy,

00:06:57.617 --> 00:06:59.585
tried to shakedown
a foreign country

00:06:59.585 --> 00:07:01.387
to interfere
in the 2020 election.

00:07:01.387 --> 00:07:03.322
His hotels raked in money
from foreign governments

00:07:03.322 --> 00:07:04.791
and lobbyists
while he was president,

00:07:04.791 --> 00:07:07.193
and he basically tried
to commit election fraud

00:07:07.193 --> 00:07:08.761
by bullying the Georgia
secretary of state

00:07:08.761 --> 00:07:10.797
to magically finding
11,000 more votes.

00:07:10.797 --> 00:07:12.465
And yet somehow, as always,

00:07:12.465 --> 00:07:14.200
he seems likely to escape.

00:07:14.200 --> 00:07:17.303
-Do you think that any
of these have traction still?

00:07:17.303 --> 00:07:19.439
-Well, I think on
the criminal cases,

00:07:19.439 --> 00:07:20.473
no, I would not.

00:07:20.473 --> 00:07:21.908
I don´t think
it´s likely Donald Trump

00:07:21.908 --> 00:07:23.976
is going to get arrested
at this point.

00:07:23.976 --> 00:07:25.511
I think there were
various places

00:07:25.511 --> 00:07:27.246
that he could and should
have been charged,

00:07:27.246 --> 00:07:30.016
from Mueller obstruction,
to January 6th,

00:07:30.016 --> 00:07:32.785
to, you know, potentially even
with the Trump Organization.

00:07:32.785 --> 00:07:35.254
But given the signs
we´re seeing from prosecutors,

00:07:35.254 --> 00:07:36.856
I don´t think
it´s particularly likely,

00:07:36.856 --> 00:07:38.291
unless something changes.

00:07:38.291 --> 00:07:39.425
-Kind of feels like
we´re in The Purge,

00:07:39.425 --> 00:07:40.793
except Donald Trump
is the only one

00:07:40.793 --> 00:07:42.328
who´s allowed to break laws.

00:07:42.328 --> 00:07:44.363
Like, he can just walk around
and do whatever he wants,

00:07:44.363 --> 00:07:46.098
and the feds for some reason
can´t touch him.

00:07:46.098 --> 00:07:47.500
At this point,
Trump could park his car

00:07:47.500 --> 00:07:49.869
in front of a fire hydrant
and instead of towing him,

00:07:49.869 --> 00:07:51.304
they just let
the building burn down.

00:07:51.304 --> 00:07:53.339
So being Donald Trump basically

00:07:53.339 --> 00:07:54.674
makes you above the law.

00:07:54.674 --> 00:07:56.909
But being close
to Donald Trump does not,

00:07:56.909 --> 00:07:58.978
which is why so many
of his aides and associates

00:07:58.978 --> 00:08:02.215
have been indicted and why his
business and his various cronies

00:08:02.215 --> 00:08:04.116
are still facing
serious consequences.

00:08:04.116 --> 00:08:05.418
If Trump´s the bull,

00:08:05.418 --> 00:08:07.320
his friends and associates
are the China shop.

00:08:07.320 --> 00:08:10.022
Trump´s like a tornado --
no one ever catches the tornado.

00:08:10.022 --> 00:08:12.758
But if you get too close to him,
you end up like the cow

00:08:12.758 --> 00:08:15.328
on top of RadioShack
5 miles from your farm.

00:08:15.328 --> 00:08:17.630
For example, the former CFO
of the Trump Organization,

00:08:17.630 --> 00:08:20.099
Allen Weisselberg, has already
been indicted for tax fraud,

00:08:20.099 --> 00:08:22.802
and this week,
his lawyers said in open court

00:08:22.802 --> 00:08:24.904
that they´re expecting
more indictments soon.

00:08:24.904 --> 00:08:26.739
-Just in to CNN,
this could be significant.

00:08:26.739 --> 00:08:30.543
News from a pretrial hearing for
the former Trump Organization

00:08:30.543 --> 00:08:32.879
CFO Allen Weisselberg.

00:08:32.879 --> 00:08:35.515
Manhattan prosecutors
have charged Weisselberg

00:08:35.515 --> 00:08:38.451
in a broad alleged
tax evasion scheme.

00:08:38.451 --> 00:08:41.754
Just moments ago,
his attorneys said in court

00:08:41.754 --> 00:08:44.156
that he has
"strong reason to believe

00:08:44.156 --> 00:08:46.659
that more indictments
are coming in."

00:08:46.659 --> 00:08:50.062
-He said that he just received
today a manila envelope

00:08:50.062 --> 00:08:51.797
that he held up in court
with a bulge in it.

00:08:51.797 --> 00:08:53.132
And he said within that,

00:08:53.132 --> 00:08:55.368
he was told that there were
three million documents.

00:08:55.368 --> 00:08:57.537
He said that these documents
were found

00:08:57.537 --> 00:08:59.472
in a co-conspirators basement

00:08:59.472 --> 00:09:01.140
and that they were
tax documents.

00:09:01.140 --> 00:09:02.542
Man, this Trump tax case

00:09:02.542 --> 00:09:04.911
has more twists and turns
than a Trump rally dance

00:09:04.911 --> 00:09:06.078
and more wrinkles than

00:09:06.078 --> 00:09:07.713
Nicki Minaj´s
cousin´s friends´s --

00:09:07.713 --> 00:09:09.749
Guys, I know we´re all

00:09:09.749 --> 00:09:11.317
rightfully focused
on other things,

00:09:11.317 --> 00:09:13.185
but apparently, while
we´re not paying attention,

00:09:13.185 --> 00:09:16.188
they´re finding manila envelopes
full of secret tax documents

00:09:16.188 --> 00:09:17.223
in the basements

00:09:17.223 --> 00:09:19.358
of Trump Organization
co-conspirators.

00:09:19.358 --> 00:09:22.628
Who´s the lead investigator,
Nicole Kidman, in a shawl?

00:09:22.628 --> 00:09:24.664
"I just found a passport
with a different name

00:09:24.664 --> 00:09:25.998
in my husband´s lockbox.

00:09:25.998 --> 00:09:27.967
I don´t know what to think."

00:09:27.967 --> 00:09:29.402
